      "   Client 1: 386 samples (Ball_014_1:39, Ball_021_1:172, IR_021_1:26, OR_007_6_1:54, OR_014_6_1:3, OR_021_6_1:92)\n",
      "   Client 2: 363 samples (Ball_021_1:5, IR_007_1:11, IR_014_1:33, Normal_1:172, OR_014_6_1:132, OR_021_6_1:10)\n",
      "   Client 3: 424 samples (Ball_007_1:46, Ball_014_1:10, Ball_021_1:46, IR_007_1:30, IR_014_1:9, IR_021_1:40, Normal_1:99, OR_014_6_1:142, OR_021_6_1:2)\n",
