      "   Edge 4: Acc=0.9706 | F1=0.9706 | Time=0.24s\n",
      "   ☁️  Cloud: Federated Averaging (FedAvg)...\n",
      "      Client weights: ['0.256', '0.241', '0.281', '0.223']\n",
      "\n",
      " Federated Model Performance:\n",
      "   Accuracy:  0.9513\n",
      "   Precision: 0.9539\n",
